{"work":"tipitaka","version":"sc-pli","book":"an1","chapter":219,"title":"17. Catutthavagga","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"“Etadaggaṁ, bhikkhave, mama sāvakānaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ bahussutānaṁ yadidaṁ ānando."},
{"v":"2","t":"… Satimantānaṁ yadidaṁ ānando."},
{"v":"3","t":"… Gatimantānaṁ yadidaṁ ānando."},
{"v":"4","t":"… Dhitimantānaṁ yadidaṁ ānando."},
{"v":"5","t":"… Upaṭṭhākānaṁ yadidaṁ ānando."},
{"v":"6","t":"… Mahāparisānaṁ yadidaṁ uruvelakassapo."},
{"v":"7","t":"… Kulappasādakānaṁ yadidaṁ kāḷudāyī."},
{"v":"8","t":"… Appābādhānaṁ yadidaṁ bākulo."},
{"v":"9","t":"… Pubbenivāsaṁ anussarantānaṁ yadidaṁ sobhito."},
{"v":"10","t":"… Vinayadharānaṁ yadidaṁ upāli."},
{"v":"11","t":"… Bhikkhunovādakānaṁ yadidaṁ nandako."},
{"v":"12","t":"… Indriyesu guttadvārānaṁ yadidaṁ nando."},
{"v":"13","t":"… Bhikkhuovādakānaṁ yadidaṁ mahākappino."},
{"v":"14","t":"… Tejodhātukusalānaṁ yadidaṁ sāgato."},
{"v":"15","t":"… Paṭibhāneyyakānaṁ yadidaṁ rādho."},
{"v":"16","t":"… Lūkhacīvaradharānaṁ yadidaṁ mogharājā”ti. Vaggo catuttho."}
]}
